{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01249",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.34,
      "end_seconds": 4.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.74,
      "end_seconds": 7.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.88,
      "end_seconds": 14.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "You came on your own today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.64,
      "end_seconds": 19.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Yes, I managed on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.57,
      "end_seconds": 22.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.1,
      "end_seconds": 33.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a red, hot area on my lower leg. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.99,
      "end_seconds": 38.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Okay, when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.88,
      "end_seconds": 41.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Probably ten days. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.5,
      "end_seconds": 45.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.63,
      "end_seconds": 50.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.78,
      "end_seconds": 55.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.8,
      "end_seconds": 61.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "I'm on valsartan, once a day for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.13,
      "end_seconds": 68.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Alright, how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.61,
      "end_seconds": 73.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "80 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.21,
      "end_seconds": 75.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.8,
      "end_seconds": 87.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.02,
      "end_seconds": 91.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.32,
      "end_seconds": 111.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.34,
      "end_seconds": 124.17,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days. I retired from the post office two years ago. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.02,
      "end_seconds": 127.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.15,
      "end_seconds": 131.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.69,
      "end_seconds": 143.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "A few quick ones: pus, vomiting or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.42,
      "end_seconds": 148.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.4,
      "end_seconds": 153.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Has there been any wound?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.1,
      "end_seconds": 157.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any wound."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.03,
      "end_seconds": 161.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.76,
      "end_seconds": 168.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.66,
      "end_seconds": 179.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.4,
      "end_seconds": 191.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.17,
      "end_seconds": 215.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 38.2 degrees, blood pressure 119 over 77, heart rate 106."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.49,
      "end_seconds": 218.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.35,
      "end_seconds": 223.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.8,
      "end_seconds": 244.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "There is a warm, red, tender patch about ten centimetres across on the right shin with mild swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.82,
      "end_seconds": 257.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Having listened and examined, this looks most like cellulitis of the right leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.38,
      "end_seconds": 260.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.39,
      "end_seconds": 286.34,
      "duration_seconds": 24.95,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now cellulitis of the right leg is my leading thought, not anything worse. I think blood tests makes sense here, for skin infection. For this, flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day, for seven days. That's for cellulitis. Mark the edge of the redness with a pen and keep the leg raised when sitting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.29,
      "end_seconds": 304.88,
      "duration_seconds": 16.59,
      "text": "The thing that would worry me is if the redness spreads quickly or you get a high fever. If that happens, go to emergency. I'd like you back in two days. What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.37,
      "end_seconds": 315.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "So, I take the flucloxacillin, 500 milligrams, four times a day and come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.68,
      "end_seconds": 322.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.21,
      "end_seconds": 325.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.77,
      "end_seconds": 327.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}